{"id":"n89060-1-7","stage":5,"title":"구형 · 旧型","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n89060-1-7-1","ko":"요즘 새로 나온 제품들 많은데 왜 구형 제품을 샀어?","zh":"最近新出的产品那么多，为什么还要买旧款呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}},{"text":"새로","meaning":"重新","explanation":"새로：重新","readings":[{"term":"새로","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67896","senseId":"2","lemma":"새로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"새로","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3"}},{"text":"나온","meaning":"上市，出品","explanation":"나오다：上市，出品；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"나오다","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62233","senseId":"6","lemma":"나오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나온","audio":"/audio/a357a1f232b9a828c908.mp3"}},{"text":"제품들","meaning":"产品，制品","explanation":"제품：产品，制品；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。","readings":[{"term":"제품","audio":"/audio/60be380dfd52bdfeffe2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70898","senseId":"1","lemma":"제품","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제품들","audio":"/audio/e241974ec09775e82df4.mp3"}},{"text":"많은데","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；은데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많은데","audio":"/audio/1f0b665a0609a87b9ab6.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"구형","meaning":"旧型，旧式","explanation":"구형：旧型，旧式","readings":[{"term":"구형","audio":"/audio/216fcf8203d923026b7c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89060","senseId":"1","lemma":"구형","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"구형","audio":"/audio/216fcf8203d923026b7c.mp3"}},{"text":"제품을","meaning":"产品，制品","explanation":"제품：产品，制品；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"제품","audio":"/audio/60be380dfd52bdfeffe2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70898","senseId":"1","lemma":"제품","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제품을","audio":"/audio/e60a8d59d5a558860a96.mp3"}},{"text":"샀어?","meaning":"买，购买","explanation":"사다：买，购买；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"샀어","audio":"/audio/99447433ba1c04adef5e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"06c6c05757e97038","term":"새로","zh":"重新","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3","entryId":"67896","definition":"与以前不同，全新地；或用新的。","pronunciation":["새로"]},{"id":"038a8038eb817ffe","term":"나오다","zh":"上市，出品","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3","entryId":"62233","definition":"新商品出现在市场上。","pronunciation":["나오다"]},{"id":"60be380dfd52bdfe","term":"제품","zh":"产品，制品","audio":"/audio/60be380dfd52bdfeffe2.mp3","entryId":"70898","definition":"使用材料制作物品；或指经此做出来的物品。","pronunciation":["제ː품"]},{"id":"b30b4bf6ab97d6a5","term":"많다","zh":"多，丰富，强","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3","entryId":"69295","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准。","pronunciation":["만ː타"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"216fcf8203d92302","term":"구형","zh":"旧型，旧式","audio":"/audio/216fcf8203d923026b7c.mp3","entryId":"89060","definition":"过时的式样或形式。","pronunciation":["구형"]},{"id":"ee0ee072926e06fc","term":"사다","zh":"买，购买","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3","entryId":"49419","definition":"用钱使某种东西或权利为己所有。","pronunciation":["사다"]}],"audio":"/audio/0dec2919ab0bbb512ff5.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n89060-1-7-2","ko":"유행이 지나긴 했지만 무척 싸더라고.","zh":"虽然已经过时了，但价格实在便宜啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"유행이","meaning":"流行，时尚，时髦","explanation":"유행：流行，时尚，时髦；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"유행","audio":"/audio/4e036fa50e83b243700b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70900","senseId":"1","lemma":"유행","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"유행이","audio":"/audio/11f96d33ff9dace3ead7.mp3"}},{"text":"지나긴","meaning":"过，过去","explanation":"지나다：过，过去；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"지나다","audio":"/audio/7d68e3b7dc1c001cae3b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82142","senseId":"1","lemma":"지나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지나긴","audio":"/audio/b84567b40dce1b114ce3.mp3"}},{"text":"했지만","meaning":"表示首先肯定或强调前句所指的状态。","explanation":"하다：表示首先肯定或强调前句所指的状态。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；지만：表示转折或让步：“但是、虽然”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62899","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"했지만","audio":"/audio/c7f6442815fb12a3f118.mp3"}},{"text":"무척","meaning":"非常，很","explanation":"무척：非常，很","readings":[{"term":"무척","audio":"/audio/9d4e17cb57a7915a0528.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55175","senseId":"1","lemma":"무척","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무척","audio":"/audio/9d4e17cb57a7915a0528.mp3"}},{"text":"싸더라고.","meaning":"便宜，贱","explanation":"싸다：便宜，贱；더라고：回顾并告诉对方亲身观察到的情况，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"싸다","audio":"/audio/b291179e0fe019b65663.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29718","senseId":"1","lemma":"싸다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"싸더라고","audio":"/audio/3da37f939230ac994a96.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"4e036fa50e83b243","term":"유행","zh":"流行，时尚，时髦","audio":"/audio/4e036fa50e83b243700b.mp3","entryId":"70900","definition":"某个事物受人欢迎，在整个社会广泛传播。","pronunciation":["유행"]},{"id":"7d68e3b7dc1c001c","term":"지나다","zh":"过，过去","audio":"/audio/7d68e3b7dc1c001cae3b.mp3","entryId":"82142","definition":"随时间流逝，脱离那个时期。","pronunciation":["지나다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示首先肯定或强调前句所指的状态。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62899","definition":"表示首先肯定或强调前句所指的状态。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"9d4e17cb57a7915a","term":"무척","zh":"非常，很","audio":"/audio/9d4e17cb57a7915a0528.mp3","entryId":"55175","definition":"程度深得别的无法与之相比。","pronunciation":["무척"]},{"id":"b291179e0fe019b6","term":"싸다","zh":"便宜，贱","audio":"/audio/b291179e0fe019b65663.mp3","entryId":"29718","definition":"价格低于一般价位。","pronunciation":["싸다"]}],"audio":"/audio/0dbb3fa45f2f58aa6b39.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.257,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=89060","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":154,"sequenceScore":3.0837,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["最近新出的产品那么多，为什么还要买旧款呢？","虽然已经过时了，但价格实在便宜啊。","在这么远的地方遇到认识的人，真是件不可思议的事啊。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["最近新出的产品那么多，为什么还要买旧款呢？","虽然已经过时了，但价格实在便宜啊。","在这么远的地方遇到认识的人，真是件不可思议的事啊。"],"answer":1}]}
